WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.225
On T57, AI advises. People decide.

2
00:00:05.425 --> 00:00:10.902
It reads prices, tariffs and supply, and turns them into one clear suggestion.

3
00:00:11.102 --> 00:00:17.408
Every suggestion shows why: verified, priced in line with the index, and ships to your port.

4
00:00:17.608 --> 00:00:20.122
You decide: accept or decline.

5
00:00:20.322 --> 00:00:24.019
And any decision against a member is reviewed by a person.

6
00:00:24.219 --> 00:00:27.235
T57. See how our AI works.
